Fileinfo: the type and the encoding of a file, guessed by its content
(libmagic bundled).

The module fileinfo of PHP 8.2 for php82 of azsupport/ports, which
installs side by side with the other versions of PHP:
lib/php/20220829/fileinfo.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d,
its headers in include/php82/php/ext/fileinfo.
